Z||000000||LarryB||08-19-2001||09:21 PM||||Dunno if anyone else mentioned this, I was on the beach yesterday working on a great sunburn and reading the September Automobile magazine when I came across this blurb that cracked me up:<P>"According to the Internet search engine AltaVista, more people searched for information on the <B>Pontiac Fiero</B> [bold type theirs, not mine] during the month of May than the beleaguered <B>Aztek</B> crossover vehicle.  Adding insult to injury, not a single person spelled the Aztek's name properly, preferring the traditional Aztec.  And this was at the height of Pontiac's Survivor television promotion. <P>hehe. ||||reg||7
